title: SalemDay0Start
---
<<declare $playerName="player">>
<<gatherVars>>

The campus café was a hotspot during lunch, but now it was calm.
Soft jazz played as you entered, only one worker in sight.

She hummed softly, drying glasses with a small smile.

She heard the wind chimes and turned toward you.

Her face looked dreamy, as if lost in thought.

<<setBool SalemDiaImageState true>>
Salem: "Hiii, welcome to Portal and Prose,"

You approached the counter.

She looked soft, with lavender hair and a warm smile.

Her presence felt welcoming, drawing you in.

-> Ask for her name
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump AskName>>
-> Make small talk
    <<jump MakeTalk>>
-> Immediately ask her to participate in the essays
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump AskForParticipant>>
===

title: AskName
---
You: "Hi… How’re you?"

She blinked, then smiled brightly, clearly happy you asked.

Salem: "Im good, thank you so much!"

Her reaction surprised you.

<<jump SinceYouNever>>
===

title: MakeTalk
---
Your fingers drummed on the counter.

She looked at you expectantly.

You: "So... are you the only one working?"

She blinked, then nodded slowly.

Salem: "Well yes I am. Others are on break right now."

Salem: "It's quiet hours, so I'm alone."

You nodded, relieved she didn’t mind the question.

<<jump SinceYouNever>>
===

title: AskForParticipant
---
You wasted no time.

You: "Hi, I'm {$playerName}. I need volunteers for my Philosophy essay."

You: "Would you be interested in participating?"

She gave an awkward smile and looked away.

Salem: "Are you here to order...?"

That felt awkward.

<<jump SinceYouNever>>
===

title: SinceYouNever
---
You weren’t familiar with the menu.

Too many options made you hesitate.

You: "Hmm... what would you recommend?"

Her eyes lit up instantly.

She placed the glass down, thinking.

Salem: "Oooo, caramel macchiato and fudge brownie!"

You nodded and ordered.

She smiled happily.

-> Compliment her hair
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump ComplimentHair>>
-> Ask about her job
    <<jump AskAboutJob>>
-> Stay silent
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump StaySilent>>
===

title: ComplimentHair
---
You noticed her hair.

You: "Your hair is really pretty."

She beamed and twirled it happily.

Salem: "Thank you!!"

She prepared your order cheerfully.

Your nerves faded.

<<jump FoodArrives>>
===

title: AskAboutJob
---
You: "What's it like being a barista?"

She hummed while preparing your drink.

She placed it on a tray.

Salem: "Hmm... it's nice, sometimes stressful though."

She added a brownie to the tray.

<<jump FoodArrives>>
===

title: StaySilent
---
You stayed quiet, unsure what to say.

She placed your drink and brownie on the tray.

She smiled softly at you.

<<jump FoodArrives>>
===

title: FoodArrives
---
Salem: "Here's your order, dear. That will be 11.99."

You paid and sat down.

-> Ask her about herself
    <<incRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump AskAboutSalem>>
-> Ask about the weather
    <<jump AskAboutWeather>>
-> Eat your food
    <<decRelationship "Salem" 1>>
    <<jump EatYourFood>>
===

title: AskAboutSalem
---
You: "So..."

She looked at you while wiping the counter.

You: "Are you in uni?"

She slowed, then smiled.

Salem: "I am actually!"
Salem: "I study here, so working here is convenient."

You chatted more as you ate.

Eventually, you finished.

<<jump LookingBackAtHer>>
===

title: AskAboutWeather
---
You sat down.

You: "Nice weather we’re having huh?"

She blinked, confused.

You looked outside.

Rain poured heavily.

Salem: "It’s raining…"

You winced.

You: "Nice for the plants..."

She nodded politely.

<<jump LookingBackAtHer>>
===

title: EatYourFood
---
You sat quietly and ate.

You decided not to risk awkward conversation.

<<jump LookingBackAtHer>>
===

title: LookingBackAtHer
---
You considered asking her to be a candidate.

After finishing, you approached the counter.

She washed her hands and came over.

Salem: "Hi dear, did you want to order more?"

You shook your head.

You: "Hi, I was wondering..."

She straightened slightly.

You: "I'm {$playerName}. I need volunteers for my Philosophy essay."

You: "Would you be interested?"

She tilted her head thoughtfully.

Salem: "Okay! I'll join,"
<<setBool SalemDiaImageState false>>

You smiled and gave her the first question.

She nodded eagerly.

You said goodbye.

She seemed nice.
===